{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1547,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa8e2e165de44b751cf1a5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要登顶……那无人能及的巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c53a1d0c3fcf140a2601810222e2cc52fc6892110cdfee897a5ee7339f5f281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2244c69cddeb035d0ef7f862",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变身！……感觉怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba5ac1a07ea5b849f37e1d58dcad5d0d7ccda4e882b6c2964f85580f2207f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:831f9bd9be46eefa1153c2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来如此，这种设计也可以有啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "378dbef913a4caaf176f4f17ba5680c68e057ddb53160b1763425f7d23f209bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01085f83a0cb09e978899f76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98622343e39286d0629ab998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早早早早上好！！\r\n呼啊～……！今天也勉强赶上了……\r\n呼哈，呼哈……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24fe9a92ec3d16bf12b5a8ef6240c0e0ba6e921beac127d9b35ad833efedbcff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3adb1ea10b486439ee3b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日旭日亦从东升！\r\n风儿亦向明日而吹！\r\n嗯，看来会是美好的一天～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502a3041831d1e7dd41f46d669dcd75bd6b35d96bdb0a66bda68b03f14bbeb22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c4f1044da6671051a27f4ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离训练还有点时间，\r\n继续干活吧！扉页修整、上色\r\n还有分镜稿……先做哪一个呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab8cb717e27367b3721b6fb547d8eb8b0a3aff1e9c4708fdbe0bc8ee35bd8e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbe50d70662456fc19a6db1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到老妈的LANE消息，她说今天的\r\n推荐电影是科幻功夫片！\r\n……她的品味真的每次都很棒呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd994d0a47ab7d74f1c11121964d53c4fdaa304e9f2984b2fc2d066f086a7a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39a7c884148b77eb92468c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去之后要在宿舍开桌游会。\r\n今天我绝对不会再只靠气势，\r\n要用逻辑……冷静地发起进攻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d6dc37def5b05497e8cd3548b659719610bffe4776227367f72c7bdd044e95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46fa5a43eaf54b02ccefa80f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "趁现在把作业做了吧……\r\n要是戴上眼镜就能获得“智力Buff”\r\n之类的就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38503b7420ef3fcb7877ab92de87ac09ef69f95a2772c2daeed0f0b7afe1544a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb5f91f4f6c4c11ea4b1cdbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在宿舍门口就开始吵架的新生们……\r\n不错不错……！如果是你们，\r\n总有一天能成为最棒的宿敌……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "662aca0aaf591d296db84661df952a7db101292d80f6888f758a7b8ead1ee30d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed3ee8d0760e889b48b4c08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满浪漫气息的积雨云！唔～\r\n到底要往里面塞进什么，\r\n才能形成那么有魅力的轮廓呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7146a3f4615272d8bf23984b357442341a6b49bc04b0f97117b677dcd8d22a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72036c526449eaa4ffd7ec47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎秋雨！尽管放马过来吧！\n我要把这当成攻克不良场地的绝佳机会——\n接招吧，『雨水粉碎』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9536932c432a5d1066e84158802d335f309c30ea6ccd407a8eb4db97ddaeb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf474c6b4a61543ab49378c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白雪与黑土的对比……在雪地中的\r\n泥地赛，从画面感来说一定超级上镜吧！\r\n要是能下雪就好了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3025d23c5e7e6b0be631fecae4f6e7f4734ac81651bb4d8a61badc04a595b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2db6c2f3b348907efed367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb60e670d6e14e3e426fdaf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少遍我都会重新创作。那个\n由我成为胜者的故事——\n小杏……哪怕是赢过你的故事也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f27d42eb8d914e230d5732554eb453c6e3cb56b9ea3197eaec9bdefbcbfcd91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18162665444814a9ab914aab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从创世酱那里借来的《传说级\r\n赛马娘·羁绊与宿命的剧历史》太棒了……\r\n人物关系图这种东西果然燃到爆啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5839b3d730ae1d190980db665ea2b576bbbd7b7e1c10f985bd41c03041e18d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bd463b40df33322aaa7c752",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "笔记本真的很能体现个性呢。像疾风酱\r\n那样用动物贴纸来点缀的方法，\r\n我之前完全没想过呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a472b0201871073c123f48f910fab5209b477d6db4a0f82f80a5ed2154c76750",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc68bc9df31903e05075c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那些燃烧灵魂进行演奏的乐手们……\n唔！皇冠邀请我参加的古典音乐会，\n真是去对了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8431b105152bfc6efd22fb4b914d655d8af5b0d14a7fff7ab315b1afd2fdb95a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5428a96a6ac7f30057f7b65b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绘画直播太有趣了！收到了那么多\n回应……要感谢教我直播方法的\n唯爱酱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84597cb68084834bbcfe8d03cf5c83084d294c779ed06f832f203cdfad04ad6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0000b532f6df57a2cf0dea3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢唱歌哦～♪因为从小就跟着\r\n《热血歌唱王武流》\r\n学习发声方法了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd75f178f6e4443d93f1062c712f003ed8c0d7c893199d7d5562263dcd2d049f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dd493082f2402cc19e9d759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是中心位置，\r\n还是卷首插画的位置我都不想让……\r\n有机会的话最好连卷首彩页也……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94ea140bda3430999bd336acb03c9b43f5d31693f667e54bf453068234eadc7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba66b245d7fd9b124db8d7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "握紧笔！前进！去描绘吧！\r\n在空白的页面上点缀色彩，\r\n讲述神业的快进击物语！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a0553ee1ac502ba89372d14437a31a121b2f5239a147a32fc541813e1a6b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340c29eb8ee8660e1b4c6f5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贝雷帽，很帅吧？\r\n嘿嘿，虽然是烂大街的款式，\r\n但果然还是很令人向往啊～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "46b7c0a42eab495ed90ff5208b28703751819c589adc9bcbaa6563342ea1e3ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34be3dc96a2ea5e5f534964d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……呜啊啊——！！\r\n啊，不是的，我没事！只是对\r\n昨天画的画感到绝望而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "70b464d6a74503686009af5a1f1b26046c51b6001469cc5b9aa3a19a0d0829b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1f7bb0de62243b8c4c5ac60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候吃饭的时候肯定会带\r\n围兜呢……以前觉得想吃得\r\n干净真的很困难啊……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1ed78f826db1704fcd6d08b9c7e53fb4c248ca83fda726aca9fd995c088484",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ea6c9f4a755222b077f6dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……《爆裂红莲拉面道》的\r\n画功实在太好了……可恶，\r\n不该在这个时间点看的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2268687cc148f5873de38922aaa9165f3c56572c5343d8d0c5a3bcc38ed97dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cc2c5bd125dc6b4dc517e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你吃过食堂里的冻豆腐和\r\n山菜煮物吗？那种温润柔和的\r\n味道真是不错呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94e36853429b9caad0b73302d9986bd74a29b5fee479a0a06f7f80c60ff9442",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabfe67458e102e757b2ed56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝉鸣声伴随着空调的运转声……还有加了冰块的\r\n冰凉可乐——唔～果然\r\n说到夏天，就是要闭关干活呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c472f1cac8940c4a4c4521db1aee47d2a8eeced6a69c28b469c700750f6002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:325b10573422cf3d5e36e510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，圣蹄祭的广告牌是我画的！\r\n『海里棒机器人』那充满机械感的\r\n身姿，很帅吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da9093e216c47a89846c3e42d7d852d5e3afd1e68c4f70779019b7c8f07de02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ed8f8db2ac0d10a0838018",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从小就不怕冷。而且皮肤\r\n也不容易干燥，\r\n保养起来很轻松呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3ea930b72ed186e054afc0e90ffb2699d2d45f44c7c61bfd90db1411ad16aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1861751d21859c56d8e9a589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去追逐那巨大的太阳吧！\r\n奔跑下去，\r\n无论到哪里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc5d923074f10d73b3b6e7360738e4b1caca65b72fda5a61616024f8ca929c4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913e1e3b2ccafcae3a5fa26b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要勇往直前！\r\n直到快要摔倒的最后一刻为止——\r\n有力地踏地前行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd8d7801458915edaaa3a2760a71f3aec66dab479d929204b2776ec72e83ecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ac5f8d5668e4db9854e27e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "充满跃动感的肌肉，\r\n到处都是啊……\r\n待会儿我要画下来♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3a9124db61ab52daaa81d8310a8cc3a56d96657fbcb6f850ac3d04d254285de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f84d90faba32e8627c2c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能听到好多脚步声呢。\r\n要是用拟声词来表达，果然还是——\r\n『咚咚咚咚咚！！』吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f42c0bcceced78f9522db18013890a7140fbf738d12c719fc6fa3f64c72f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:237241a9294d86c1edaba00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有忘带什么东西？\r\n纸和笔我随时都能拿出来，\r\n请不用客气尽管开口哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "deefff083d07f6b80eb853a997e9be766ba9e8c2a483cbcaad78fd7361a9c76a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620df02b1881fc5ad427d304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——等一下，保持原样，\r\n别动！……真棒啊，\r\n那副胸怀静谧热情的表情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "678753d2b8a444a7b393a375a936b90f5ec74480768a3c87ae7d3d5c7d65c766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66944b89e1d2a9f0d46aa0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时我会思考为什么要创作故事……\r\n一定是因为想让以前的自己开心吧。\r\n那个爱做白日梦的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb50acdcd1a89a84acd00556c337b247c446aba67b3b230f7c7ede730c2ce9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6d82c9714902ee3e14de92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前经常在沙滩上画画！\r\n刚画好原创角色的脸，\r\n就被海浪冲走消失了……啊哈哈……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4c8fb5b06b0bfa0c5224f677fa136082dda0f62f768cdf12cee7b7f2135869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ff67f4807b171216e70d0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是由我们两人共同描绘的、最棒的故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23815e81f7dc444897bc222a6f0986e1125379b90eb9491a654c67cf435e3940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40dfc9d7b92ae8cd65eb24f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "堂堂完结！感谢您的阅读♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3e63367fe654e5fe26a6dd72682d5d342ce8a9497d6a15eee70aeee7603c2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a918207b8604eccbc39464fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注入斗魂！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbfb109ab0b188f6c68ec65d48e5e44e579e4f7edab94038d191dbab465ca7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6bc2d3de06b7a4386025c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想象力是没有极限的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69d051dbf1dd229a4ee61fa07880843d38b04439d7d6d4ec445c5b6c2c5b9c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60328a75ba5e0e115214c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是神业！让我们一起创作扣人心弦的故事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce5bba57caebc9a3e4bac28bdc215a9333401e188969350470e55674ed4d016e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c0919171dc5125d9fc86bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃尽灵魂的神业物语！\r\n我就是时代的主人公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ae224496d94a16d438a8ca204ae90b2d814c81e782eb6c4c89463d247544dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b24e2b3b2e65faad4852500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "协同效应拉满！",
      "source_fingerprint": "820d9e75b5a8944096a372a5897618a1a40f5c1fcc48d74508769bebc66d2f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7816120df72b2573b1f2bb01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起来搞点“创新”吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70223fb5a952d5585a367b85ec0f767f105f4b9fcbe2190f7d3d44acc87e8f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17cb088bf3c63dfc67e1308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设限之类的也太没意思了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af485318565adbe6fd5a4b1efd33b0e27c3223ab88fa19880ad65da7568bc4a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca47589dec666ab45a72df22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起激发协同效应吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb7fe7e1d53c005416c374b0ed95bbf2c2660ce3b89712e73234667938abaa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd39e624b588a384edb8590c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要将哪场比赛定为目标呢？\n请结合赛马娘的适应性\n来决定吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a867c7f6eed11c79cbb78a2c2d9ecc9d5b8bda080c5f25d307107bedd82dc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000ea52cec6003862cf1a945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据最终目标的不同，\r\n此前的参赛计划也会随之改变哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44944be12f22b7008c196fa4fee9ab0cab9c0d6fbc961a608b1fe784c428d454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c1109e030d807d3217eba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们将以目标BC赛事为前提制定计划。\r\n请慎重地做出决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25bac7df0b5e32bcd066d31342e03ca41f2faae948dc3b311fe5d8dcecd90efb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3c9f3c953e836e4df54c04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是所谓的伙伴关系，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90df9738aa533b26c876dcc54d8473233c66ca32cd9989d6385e486749312437",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd929027da69118d3f939982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是全面的业务提携！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afb3c44c7f8743f05897c41cd171dc12b492ea7eeca3768b38eddf2c61a0fbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38891fb54a8176c5ee252de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道路由我来开拓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af92a9efaa802a99f8d55877dd7cc2495cd7a231b67ac02857d361c5961cc996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb37d4b2899dec2ec57bc96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一眼就看出来你就是我的训练员！\n我们被命运紧紧相连！\n现在的你肯定也明白了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c2d8258304ff316420e177d70b0ad2a56ce7f4349a2a71271fc11d7c6b8ecc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31a85ef1e5c5a142fb6f97b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a81719318f354a289fa32effff3e0060c6af596527f262f806d5f1b7f27b877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827f0db52f7fdc6bf51456ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93a0bf87ee3237011fb0bcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望你能一直陪在我身边！只要\n有你在身后推我一把，哪怕是遥不可及\n的远方命运，我也定能一把抓住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c113ed1c064c6e73002ec5e159f62915925c85fce0e54bc0818d312ceda9d3d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c8e304076df47f935a16f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我又找到了新的乐趣！\r\n那就是你最棒的笑容！我要把那份笑容，\r\n一次又一次不断刷新下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c466535a3f04ed463a36f4c0fb5908b83b6caeb9dba88b767a785c049d1ca2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6ca264a0b60dbece840979",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！新年第一件事要干什么……\r\n啊，捣年糕大会！我想分给大家吃！\r\n好嘞，石臼在哪里！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bad22bc66a7cd22ca2179742770a0983c66927f61fc9e9ad5dd150ad0f85118e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a03568fcf3eaa06919d8cbd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的巧克力，是我昨晚灵光一闪的即兴\r\n配方！专门为了你而降临的配方……\r\n这绝对超级美味哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb9a8badee3bc44c3b20ecd01043757abe3bed93f27840913c4c7dfd0b342d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cce424bd20f8fd201f2edd80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "倾注了特别心意的巧克力，拥有能\n引出你特别笑容的力量！\n今年也让我看看你的那个表情吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "553c5224b04853bbc926253b4cc4b8e175d3d0285dd089901a203f889f4f9309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23454950405741f04570043c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么愿望都可以挂上去试试！\r\n在所有的梦想实现之前，\r\n我都会在背后为大家加油鼓劲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f6770d71eca9d655913beb8db2367fe1b46cec17c8d365794ebeb2a405fcea8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fef5a99c31d3c6b7c63d0da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难道你不想见识一下点心山脉的样子吗？\n我想看！所以……全学院的点心，\n就由我统统收集过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0960236312954393b25c7ffbca83eb27bce5bc0f8727ca6e7cdcac2d4a589ba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f8a7b18ec8ab9d0b31a3bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是知道的哦！圣诞老人\r\n绝对是存在的！没错，就存在于想着我、\r\n为我送上礼物的父亲的心中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49eeef40260aff8b8eca7584afbf428110397ba6a65899d82168d74de2a649b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1b73680de658ddfd8bacd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大人收不到礼物……\r\n那只要由我来当圣诞老人就行了！\r\n把最棒的礼物，送给最棒的你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cdb193eaba76a2fc09b0be0c5626b90ca0dd07286dc511fbed3383a8f40bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c5502b63058a5de2c1324fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是，命运！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a02544ec91dae128e61e6901df63ab2f3a937ceb5ae12f29cfc38baac84fd97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7d76d5e8ca83f8ddff87c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明年会发生什么？我能知道的只有……\r\n那就是一切，都会被我统统转变成\r\n对你而言最美好的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73ced051be9a081774b8f707bacbde8e465fa27dffcb8ee31c20cdc2afd116f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e806ef22948c4cec98dac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！我准备了蛋糕……\r\n不对，先看礼物展示比较好吗？\r\n我还准备了回忆放映会哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f60c1d2af49f76734aac83f3534b8ef380816c4b7e678c7048ea5d140f325e38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b012dd1912b419f1e10b8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一年里，我也学到了很多……\r\n比如该怎么让你露出最灿烂的笑容！\r\n今后也让我向你多学学吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33911f89e56e0aa627781ffadfc259ce312a0b6877d0a32a94a7af916e04f874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e0e2999e338db6fc9719db6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "庆祝生日当然要吃国王饼！\r\n每年当上国王的雷打不动都是我！\r\n你能从我手里夺走王座吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8dc6cd2a3d5a605ad07e6fe097c504c749ad62827703e66d77602163177e1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3562311b1363045abc3c406f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物嘛……你就可以了！\r\n没错，就是喜笑颜开的你！告诉我，\r\n你想和我一起做些什么吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb9d2c7bd2d49cea0f895900de5b714be91045131f076d6a42a7bab10ce7ff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18493264c6196cf6301bc1e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你的通知送过来了！\r\n难道是全新命运的开端吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c693bf153615b237fc76a196fb23d4ff0af502eb066491e1973b8999a8908e10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81578a62615669f5a99cb0ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有送给你的礼物哦！\r\n里面到底装了什么啊！？\r\n……等不及了！快点快点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2fea9f95e057aa7ca9787d8aeb9d7091f10203fb26f9593f8466cade529b87e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5c4dfd837c022c98415deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不愧是你！你太棒了！\r\n我就知道你一定能做到！……啊！\r\n我说的是完成的任务啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13b9f837bc2d25cafbc52bbafb7b25156073779243e5703c7b9ca4ad28f1d398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b77ee16a260181553e773bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感受到了……最棒的活动的跃动！\r\n『命运之声』也是这么说的！\r\n要把全场气氛炒热起来的，就是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e087ee39979a2073bfdf96fd52e02b5b14b06a5d4aac35082bb8b36bdb2f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892fb4abe114b6768bc4da68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动！活动！是活动啊！\r\n要去对吧？嗯，看你的表情就很想去！\r\n好，出发！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bae52f6176f9e4b05d6195673314631e5e2162313b26a88157c71f2fd15a826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be166ac636af18131a0f0da6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总有一天会跨越过去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af0e4b13836e7a2e48c1f0bda93d9c6ee7cb6b0dbaea6028c0aeb72ee9567996",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47be19e59bbe3ca4b6afa35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！快看快看！\r\n赛马娘名册的等级提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91e1b7cb11811d27819555cd0bbf1790b7028730f6f317c7ff9d8dec1149b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1141",
        "10021"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
